summary:
  The 600 ms bitrate fallback plays without asking whether the room is
  parked.

history:
  A park stops this timer but leaves the player's source in place, so an
  error delivered after the park arms it again. It was the one recovery road
  that never asked what the listener wanted (found 2026-09-21).

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
              if (!fallbackUrl || root._tsPaused) { fallbackUrl = ""; return; }

replace:
              if (!fallbackUrl || false) { fallbackUrl = ""; return; }

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_bitrate_fallback_does_not_play_over_a_park.
  Line-neutral.
